{"unit_id":"kyo615__dsh-browser-control#card-zh","repo":"kyo615/dsh-browser-control","commit":"9c10f2c42999947a2c8009443994f6297d472b8c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-control 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的浏览器自动化插件。它通过 Playwright MCP 启动真实的 Chrome 浏览器，并把 MCP 提供的浏览器工具注册给 DSH 中的 AI。插件在对话运行卡片中显示浏览器状态、当前网址和实时截图，也提供网址跳转、刷新画面、重启和关闭操作。宿主端会从工作区解析 Playwright MCP 程序，并通过 HTTP 路由提供截图。适合需要让 DSH 助手浏览网页并在界面观察操作过程的用户；运行需要 Node.js、Chrome 或 Edge，以及可用的 @playwright/mcp。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:207","lib/index.js:235","lib/index.js:279","lib/client.js:36"]}
{"unit_id":"kyo615__dsh-browser-control#card-en","repo":"kyo615/dsh-browser-control","commit":"9c10f2c42999947a2c8009443994f6297d472b8c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browser-control lets DSH control real Chrome through Playwright MCP. It registers browser tools for the AI and shows status and live screenshots in a conversation panel. Users can navigate, refresh, restart, or close the browser. Requires Node.js, Chrome or Edge, and @playwright/mcp.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:207","lib/index.js:235","lib/index.js:279","lib/client.js:36"]}
